<h4>3. 畫筆如何選擇？</h4>
<p>建議準備三種：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>畫筆</th>
<th>形狀</th>
<th>適合用途</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Flat</td>
