<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-qRZva6mUqjLuFfxw77qNSHjZhqJ-wZt78hhAu6WW4daZ7qWaQHnlkrzenpjKBSMRepbm19qrokV8a8ZWvMOwGf68BbD_EXh5xrIOZi3jZPFJsioHJgeaB9rQTpxH6skcvlwmF_yAuBJmrFpvj29X34Ru0zf9MGAFonR1yATTwA?purpose=inline">Camlin Kokuyo Canvas Board – Juplay World</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/thRNQnLnpk4WAmqB1G1RaMdAPwmBWI0OD3IAxELDm2rCD8DniSHab6Ta8e1zOSmnpdUgQKSVK3lKsTzIamKeWRT72NOJxd_5GpoHdByA8uafEVqzTMT5XLL4hXPdgdJiXoG67QQ9-iE2AYYPMKBBXdbtZoEEarMkeGbewUGGFOk?purpose=inline">Artists Stretched Canvas - STANDARD Depth - WHITE PRIMED Cotton - SING – WoW Art Supplies</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/aNejMmSs0969tzu97P8sLlYtQc70fuX8z-bOHS_We07jeF3Ea79GrKliT8iEoMZJ5jN9ksKKTJprte_Q9fQ0SPDdvf_HjUPsJ6gl54Z49PYt98ecceOxG0shPuiSRxnqdZB_e-xKCqCjULtmF3WAQ_vmLMGWsZdj1lgnsFyoviQ?purpose=inline">Winsor &amp; Newton Acrylic Pad A4 300g | Pen Store</a></p>
<p>8</p>
<p>初學者可以選：</p>
<ol>
<li>畫布板（Canvas Panel）：價格通常較低，適合練習。</li>
<li>棉布畫布（Cotton Canvas）：適合正式創作。</li>
<li>壓克力專用畫紙（Acrylic Paper）：方便攜帶及反覆練習。</li>
</ol>
<p>建議第一批購買 20×25 cm 或 30×40 cm 的畫布板。</p>
<p>一般畫布若已經有適合壓克力使用的底料，可以直接開始作畫，不一定需要重新塗 Gesso。</p>
<h4>四、壓克力畫的八種核心技法</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/yoCbXJBpPIBMqBAvaF0mqmYgJneuxE3rmea9Rm5qAQMUGr0ENrB6UR-2MV-gXycTc3zMlcBc6ccVDjZYj10i0kE8jMdx-XSy4aWe3iJwHsTrCxNnpc75dNhQrEjMl_SCnBiSvOlrjY3DGAXnkfdFY4NRDmjavfIk2w8i82bXlN4?purpose=inline">Beginner Acrylic Painting Guide</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ME0UQ0joJoVLdqMLNEmNL749j7smV28W3ouTdMxFJss3X5PeiQ4ZGFZrldeZPeO60rgbBtjY8xom1QyCNT6-ipxH5Jc5PG5taxBb0P9XbUJWwJlutFpSUFVjHihVH3P3JONnDW6bUzAD6aBgVr5Sy3J_7UcKgZUBVrXkRCO69D8?purpose=inline">How to Blend Acrylic Paint for Smooth Transitions?</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/XGPs7b7VGetvVM6e7oTZIXIuzssL1cV5zOYRWt4i_lhwo_ZeIoUlzP6vBoIuKncppgOGn05MejZI65XoIW7txmxPdkkDZHZxoPrd7AXKMV-5XRu3PjVM1guNvOjl50ploUZNzp7pT6nnMt-NtcnRvSrBa_XRLyU_Lgzwfg6-SxE?purpose=inline">How to Work with Super Thick Acrylic Paint: Artist’s Guide – Master Maker Crafts</a></p>
<p>10</p>
<h4>1. 平塗（Flat Wash）</h4>
<p>用寬扁筆均勻塗色。</p>
<p>練習：</p>
<ul>
<li>塗出一個正方形。</li>
<li>不要留下明顯空隙。</li>
<li>保持顏色均勻。</li>
<li>練習不同方向的筆觸。</li>
</ul>
<h4>2. 濕畫濕（Wet-on-Wet）</h4>
<p>在尚未乾燥的顏料上加入另一種顏色。</p>
<p>用途：</p>
<ul>
<li>天空漸層。</li>
<li>花瓣色彩。</li>
<li>背景混色。</li>
</ul>
<p>由於壓克力乾燥很快，初學者可以使用專用延緩乾燥媒介，延長操作時間。</p>
<h4>3. 乾刷（Dry Brushing）</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Wiz1E0ViHoTaqMYVIXRBcYcurxW9BGOhD0gDnkDpB5BO1x5gR9mG3CVPgOpf42KIKZmLdGZGcr5YLjNuxl17K4KPTVFEI4CwRn6bsu20WAPvicktVJKV3YYepHalFd8pXqFvX7QCQDjDt67njwMNmohFfahjZyi3SwlsMifokrU?purpose=inline">Dry Brush Techniques in Acrylic: Complete Step-by-Step Guide - Art And Me</a></p>
<p><a href="https://wp.artandme.eu/en/dry-brush-techniques-in-acrylic-complete-step-by-step-guide/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">wp.artandme.eu</a></p>
<p>操作：</p>
<ol>
<li>使用較硬的畫筆。</li>
<li>沾取少量顏料。</li>
<li>在紙巾上擦掉多餘顏料。</li>
<li>輕輕刷過畫布。</li>
</ol>
<p>適合畫樹木、岩石、草地及粗糙表面。</p>
<h4>4. 透明罩染（Glazing）</h4>
<p>將透明壓克力媒介與顏料混合，薄薄覆蓋在已乾燥的底色上。</p>
<p>例如：</p>
<p>先畫黃色，再覆蓋透明紅色，可以產生橙紅色的視覺效果。</p>
<p>注意：透明罩染應使用適當的壓克力媒介，不要單純加入大量水來代替媒介。</p>
<h4>5. 厚塗（Impasto）</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/GuO8O4yuiF6-lwzbXhFoQOP6u1sfG24XJBktLbVCZDUXaODmBokMYuzxgerjSsFc-1U4YjMPbZaxrGL_HSRqRZdiHgkqbgqP-V6b6JdwkjaZYYr1pGbZbCVUbxXQ5nSIw-gOIUAqqLZBCf7VsiY1KpchHFqOZt8K2xItKrNCVKs?purpose=inline">How To Paint 3D Mountain Landscapes with Acrylics | Debasree Dey | Skillshare</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.skillshare.com/en/classes/how-to-paint-3d-mountain-landscapes-with-acrylics/1663309880?utm_source=chatgpt.com">skillshare.com</a></p>
<p>這是壓克力最有趣的技法之一。</p>
<p>操作：</p>
<ol>
<li>使用 Heavy Body 顏料。</li>
<li>直接從顏料管取出顏料。</li>
<li>使用調色刀堆疊顏料。</li>
<li>讓每一層保留凸起紋理。</li>
</ol>
<p>如果需要更厚的立體效果，可以使用壓克力凝膠媒介或塑形膏（Modeling Paste）。</p>
<h4>6. 點彩（Stippling）</h4>
<p>使用筆尖或海綿點出不同顏色。</p>
<p>適合：</p>
<ul>
<li>花朵。</li>
<li>樹葉。</li>
<li>草地。</li>
<li>遠方景物。</li>
</ul>
<h4>7. 海綿技法（Sponge Painting）</h4>
<p>使用海綿沾取顏料，在畫布上形成不規則紋理。</p>
<p>適合雲朵、樹葉、石頭及背景。</p>
<h4>8. 刮刀技法（Palette Knife）</h4>
<p>利用調色刀將顏料推開、刮除或堆疊，產生類似油畫的筆觸。</p>
<p>這種方法特別適合山景、海景及抽象畫。</p>
<p>上述技法也可以參考 Canson 的壓克力透明與不透明技法說明，以及 Winsor &amp; Newton 的入門指南。</p>
<p><a href="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://en.canson.com&amp;sz=32">image</a></p>
<p>Canson®+2</p>
<h4>第四部分：水彩畫的器材與購買指南</h4>
<h4>一、水彩顏料有哪些種類？</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/q-2OdUXez60gjJxgprNWU9pgXM2bPvWGe96b0Ox5fT8NDvzxJ62YWGX430PwCEwDyS7g8LYxrWkH9EHsT3aR0aUYFRSo9-W1FdfthFslMFBHqxmxk7nlOTGwUIexl67rnjp8AYlQHLiTrHPJGel9W2UXr02Uyye6xGyWvPmc-jk?purpose=inline">Professional Watercolour Tube Travel Tin - 12 Tubes – Winsor &amp; Newton</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/jCmyd0G6OfNPoAgtOePZeIpwT9ORrHl1hFHCsPOcH7a3fWruCUTGM8fGcWXveCT5nikOT89CsVuayUllFeRV16FojeQ6uNgiiKtEkO5m1GxUMoUBFH0B8YC8OTUYASzTeZ6IedIuW1MXyps6kHlkXo7dshDk7COvdHNm328LTuw?purpose=inline">MEEDEN Travel Water Color Paint Palette Tin with 48 Half Pans - Blue</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/dXtUKurUWj7AnyiWM9UnsUF-KceHTPAylIH56ptuRd2Zg5alq3pzg6wbnoyVFtfSYnrUqAD3BYyXUP0lxd_rrPEAFJ955vXFJtko7eZ_H5ypy52ywp8MApIbSdQjbatrbMlbVtVG1QD3Syd-25cOvEuP74hYFs3Qac6_SiUpms8?purpose=inline">Excel Folding Watercolor Palette – Federal Color</a></p>
<p>10</p>
<p>水彩顏料主要分為兩種。</p>
<h4>1. 塊狀水彩（Pan Watercolor）</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Sa6-_mSsT--W3LAvLq0AAqaxNzmROcohgqgpdTdq6cO8DjIeH0vGH5tHLh91AAXLuJbePilPqxN_N3OXVz1qsKHhTIEij80woOB0tl63su23o4P1YZGfBCl1SWhGB1VE57kO4B3nyN9R-_xxYYGrJ-b8UXsD2JhV7i3N8DQqlbg?purpose=inline">Horadam Watercolor Half Pan, #031 ONETZ Wetting Agent – St. Louis Art Supply</a></p>
<p><a href="https://shop.stlartsupply.com/products/horadam-watercolor-half-pan-031-onetz-wetting-agent?utm_source=chatgpt.com">shop.stlartsupply.com</a></p>
<p>顏料已經製成小塊狀，使用時用濕畫筆沾取。</p>
<p>優點：</p>
<ul>
<li>方便攜帶。</li>
<li>不容易浪費。</li>
<li>適合旅行寫生。</li>
<li>容易控制顏料用量。</li>
</ul>
<p>初學者可以先購買 12 色或 24 色套裝。</p>
<h4>2. 管狀水彩（Tube Watercolor）</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/dplkN9MukXGEnDTEsKJoaSacceQr5zlT-DzV-GdqM1GeG7aERL0LML9pKL1IxZO1lf9DoYojKD8wnD29dAiM_jNIRN4vxfDsbHeI8lovklNBpHmeoqamK6lB3LxGUmW2F5H6_rUc1p941-GWwGicjawa3d23K2lR66KLb-kxxOI?purpose=inline">Which Is Better for You: Watercolour Pans or Tubes?</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.everything-art.blog/post/pans-vs-tubes-choosing-your-watercolours?utm_source=chatgpt.com">everything-art.blog</a></p>
<p>顏料以膏狀包裝，使用時擠到調色盤上。</p>
<p>優點：</p>
<ul>
<li>可以快速取得大量顏料。</li>
<li>容易調出濃郁色彩。</li>
<li>適合大幅畫作。</li>
<li>可以補充塊狀水彩。</li>
</ul>
<p>如果主要在家中練習，管狀水彩很適合；如果希望攜帶出去寫生，塊狀水彩比較方便。</p>
<h4>二、初學者應該準備哪些水彩顏色？</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/XE7JBa--tYQc43zQGIibLlOj9k1e8BLQ9g9FS95E29oQ8Ve4SXRgpi8hz1w0FOLpqopsoR6ytOhmuzgsOEnNy12BZ2jIzIoONTB7ZS0qmrg9YYos9sR9iscSL_cJhXqAHu2lhlk0a-g8OmpIZitRRGHgHBTDwvOmrJWvDeO5P5g?purpose=inline">Jane Blundell Artist: Just 6 Colours - a lovely limited palette.</a></p>
<p><a href="https://janeblundellart.blogspot.com/2014/06/just-6-colours-lovely-limited-palette.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com">janeblundellart.blogspot.com</a></p>
