<p>注意：不同品牌的顏料名稱與實際色料可能不同，購買時可以查看顏料的色料編號、透明度與耐光性。</p>
<h4>三、水彩紙是最重要的器材之一</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/uJGMgOZgqjvpHMZR_K1y5yAAkiIljcKfPcittPxLErgdBs3UOK-CPxNQCm72ogNJII9ZA0sWbaGP4AbAKwuU2FbcxX3V2hBmlWK3l-CDOGqiIcrfTLirFoNPnAlbuY0FRyaZCoKGR0-KwLRG7_z1MsbLspfOTnsYfC7GaBE5QSo?purpose=inline">Bockingford Watercolor Paper, St Cuthberts Mill | TALAS</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Ffyz6L_t8Ysh7OcGVFQQgQFuiW1ejGrzKaoTN-a6KBZdELLeqyLvBbAW1oBjJtf_Jranu0mfVBV7XcdHhjbrYULHf9ncIJW9k0lz68mE1PDb_c_OM15QYzEllR7h4MtcvkWI9w5xZpGxqjCt68vNqozAY5EprwFh4vQ5J3NS1U4?purpose=inline">Lawrence : Bockingford : Watercolour Pad : A4 : 300gsm : Hot Press : Smooth : 10 sheets | Jackson's Art</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/e0kYt22S4-agJdRTr2XABVAJAJhubjsutgv_5t9yLyaGL0n8i4EJgVi8n7wL-dJSwrTUvSbP64GMIt6jFAOxgqNxL7dDAaPA9ah8DVl9byw1PzG6TemrU6IlU23phjDGbDL5y_g_LUlBDu6-fUESjvU9J-Fm1Vjqa61qzOPHmfw?purpose=inline">Arches Aquarell-Papier rau 185 g/qm 56x76 cm</a></p>
<p>水彩畫的紙張會直接影響顏料的流動、乾燥及筆觸效果。</p>
<p>水彩紙主要有三種：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>種類</th>
<th>英文</th>
<th>表面特性</th>
<th>適合用途</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>粗紋紙</td>
<td>Rough</td>
<td>紋理明顯</td>
<td>風景、自然質感</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>中粗紋紙</td>
<td>Cold Press</td>
<td>適度紋理</td>
<td>初學者最推薦</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>細紋紙</td>
<td>Hot Press</td>
<td>表面平滑</td>
<td>細節、插畫</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h4>紙張重量</h4>
<p>建議選擇：</p>
<ul>
<li>190 gsm：一般練習。</li>
<li>300 gsm：最推薦。</li>
<li>640 gsm：厚紙，較不容易因水分產生變形。</li>
</ul>
<p>初學者建議直接使用 300 gsm 的冷壓水彩紙。</p>
<p>紙張太薄時，大量水分容易造成紙面起皺。</p>
<h4>四、水彩畫需要哪些畫筆？</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/y4_jnqM_gA3i8Rj4PQCbQooC8ToJVXaTeC5Y0VpAgFpxTvOyi4tSGK53l219SbLSmJUrn9ihJu1G1AjxFCMKH0hjPABT37LnpMmW1bzKCgG6EwEhqy_pmGvlnEFMTXIfG6q2Y3WLv2hPmR1kUurR9kXcfBYP4ZOPBfvEWN8oU00?purpose=inline">Princeton Neptune Synthetic Squirrel Brush - Round, Short Handle, Size 12 | BLICK Art Materials</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zu-S7fWAzIUdk4hFWeGo9OfMUf4kOZkpu8WuOBcWQbFDgEl6ipgru5ZOS_teWlF3LuxIIWCkR9vjx39GO7EKTY9f-AkgC8QuLrHM6UNIRRklWJ-W5FYkIQbstsT_URuoa8GUbbrjo5YVJZpmThmaw0DBzMKyNrHpxrObEl4q1VA?purpose=inline">Finesse™ 8750-1 1/2 Sky Wash — KINGART</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/PNe-aO5BTC4U48AZfg9hxKWshmtSAi9mzn4RO1dqLZYkPmk-H9RFa_c5tRjzuYjhgOjqKGJtlOFopajs865SOWvzbZTbfRZMlDO-fOeUykG59Xsecb-J1Uu472GHd1vTzUkXEXXMXO5nNV0csRCvF9WKt64l0dgSVZ32kuGc6nA?purpose=inline">Princeton™ Aqua Elite™ Synthetic Mop Watercolor Brush, Size: 1.6 cm | Michaels</a></p>
<p>6</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>畫筆</th>
<th>用途</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Round 圓頭筆</td>
<td>大部分繪畫</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Flat 扁平筆</td>
<td>大面積上色</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Mop 大水彩筆</td>
<td>大面積水洗</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Detail 細節筆</td>
<td>細線、細節</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Filbert 橢圓筆</td>
<td>特殊形狀及柔和筆觸</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>水彩筆與油畫、壓克力畫筆不同，通常需要較柔軟且蓄水能力好的筆毛。</p>
<p>建議最初購買：</p>
<ul>
<li>2 號圓頭筆。</li>
<li>6 號圓頭筆。</li>
<li>10 號圓頭筆。</li>
<li>12 號扁平筆。</li>
</ul>
<p>不需要一開始就購買高價天然松鼠毛筆，品質良好的合成纖維筆也能完成很多練習。</p>
<h4>五、其他必要工具</h4>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/u6HiPyAGdjdNe4fiK_cjfTZyvJ8sgLslQocDUhzHYAb-4npkwN5DNZOO_CwjmYhZbxDRx3tQwwde72CUxSPl0lwmMsX92bC36QRx_RhsuE12sjPWUVHh4roOOYEBn_mH6dwa7j8om33xpcEOpvw61tFa5-eh1ucgd7yIT_BSOX4?purpose=inline">Using Masking Fluid with Watercolors: Everything You Need to Know</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/p6YexrdrW2IQRnw9oOwKvMhcaNtb9dnR1dcvNSn9g4Xm6MbsUi4RWkFJxFOFYPqDJgC0QQPrvweCWiQcENBZ_xhwfUbjhyyH51dB2HlzI2XLgbxna2or0y36fxmig3P0ljOzkrTxOJ7SO9SyndnDDZSp-VYmumCM142zwz_Sr1gwOIIYXSrtfTKPxe2rpz1-?purpose=inline">Blank Cold Press Rough Watercolor Paper Taped on Wooden Drawing Board</a></p>
<p><a href="https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/T-kWqdZocsptV_t2s6Tof6L1WVkj9MSru4aJCreSKttSoHg5RzCbUa2whjAsMTMbjqus5xcySzfRoYhj7NTQR3AoZ_Oe2m6kl61XM7934wnJKegG_gHjXgDmKsDYrKDJVJ4jh262lnsP_YMYUxXRaxUNA2EnRyy4J9TVi6YokiQ?purpose=inline">Top Tips for Using Masking Fluid — Louise De Masi Watercolour Artist</a></p>
