<th>對應的傳統技法</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Acrylic Brush</td>
<td>壓克力平塗</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Bristle Brush</td>
<td>豬鬃筆觸</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Watercolor Brush</td>
<td>水彩效果</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Wet Brush</td>
<td>濕畫濕</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Texture Brush</td>
